{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>His strength</b> — You are the El whose strength belongs to Him in Himself." "<b>To You I will keep watch</b> — Like the sense of ליל שמורים (a night of watchings), corresponding to וישמרו את הבית (and they shall guard the house); therefore he said: Awake."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 59, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:15.581986570Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}